			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["48FAA6DBC81EED3F"]
			description: ["&eA ring of metal and silence. You remember standing here, but the memory slides away like water. It was important. It was terrible. What did it do?&r"]
